          "text": "Ops skin test. Take the drop box and plug it into the office port. Sweep the office network, scan the file server, check its service and confirm what you find. The notes in the cabinet by the door can be used on a confirmed finding. The comms room is to the north.",
          "observations": "A sign on a stand by the front desk."
        }
      ],
      "npcs": [
        {
          "id": "ian",
          "displayName": "Ian Okafor",
          "npcType": "person",
